{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/Creature_Pedia_\u4f5c\u54c1\u5185\u5bb9_3.jpg?t=1744740044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s a rumor about strange, scary monsters hiding in the Magic Academy. No one has really seen them, but the school\u2019s headmaster is super worried. So, they posted a job to find these monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re just a broke college student who accidentally took the job! You don\u2019t know anything about magic, but now you\u2019ve gotta survive, solve weird problems, and catch some monsters to get that reward money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be a Little Detective!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to funny characters, do missions, and play mini-games to help people with their magic troubles. When you help them, they\u2019ll give you cool magical items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/\u9304\u88fd_2024_11_04_20_35_28_757_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1744740044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make Your Own Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find magical stuff around the school, mix them the right way, and summon your very own cute (or creepy) monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/\u5408\u6210\u5f71\u7247.gif?t=1744740044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Explore with Your Monster Buddies</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take your monsters with you and explore the school! Find hidden stories, secrets, and lots of magical adventures!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555890?t=1744740044","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3555890?t=1744740044","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/34e58444239ed4b9b8518cd77637abafa1b769d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744740044","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/34e58444239ed4b9b8518cd77637abafa1b769d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744740044","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/Creature_Pedia_\u4f5c\u54c1\u5185\u5bb9_3.jpg?t=1744740044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There\u2019s a rumor about strange, scary monsters hiding in the Magic Academy. No one has really seen them, but the school\u2019s headmaster is super worried. So, they posted a job to find these monsters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You\u2019re just a broke college student who accidentally took the job! You don\u2019t know anything about magic, but now you\u2019ve gotta survive, solve weird problems, and catch some monsters to get that reward money!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Be a Little Detective!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Talk to funny characters, do missions, and play mini-games to help people with their magic troubles. When you help them, they\u2019ll give you cool magical items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3555890/extras/\u9304\u88fd_2024_11_04_20_35_28_757_00_00_00-00_00_30.gif?t=1744740044\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Make Your Own Monsters</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find magical stuff around the school, mix them the right way, and summon your very own cute (or creepy) monsters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\